    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-echo-diver=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"It's not that you're faster. It's that the moment is slower, on your side of it.\"</em></p><p><strong>Stormread Initiative (passive).</strong> Flat +2 bonus to initiative — auto-applied via system.derived.initiative.bonus.</p><p><strong>Stormread (1/Soma Break).</strong> Bonus action — deliver a warning to one willing ally within 6 squares who can hear and understand you. That ally may immediately use their reaction to move up to half their speed without provoking reaction strikes.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"echoDivEmpyreanStormread\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Stormread</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break (active) + passive +2 init  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Picker (Stormread · Stormread Initiative)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Active: bonus-action ally warning grants them a half-speed reaction-move w/o provoking. Passive: +2 initiative auto-applied.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
